From 07c0937de40dbc8ca74763d8a5313ca0d873299d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:24:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0193 pauline+toad playable: split models + redirect
 registration

Pauline (CityMayor, 72 bones) was missing AllRoot/ToeL/ToeR + the 4
Sub bones; her face is a separate skeleton (56 bones grafted).
Toad (KinopioNpc, 42 bones) was missing the 4 Sub bones. Both split
into the 7 Mario-matching parts (body/head/eye/face/cap/handL/handR)
and grafted like Peach. Register pauline->CityMayor and toad->Toad in
dm_char_redirect (hle_fs.c). Character cards/art are in 0194.
Device-only risks: proportions, neck seams, cap throw, Pauline's
static face (no blink in v1).
